  linear on g_obs: 1/(sigma g_obs)^2                  +0.0000        +0.0000        +0.0000
  log (inverse variance in log acceleration)          -0.0000        -0.0000        +0.0000
  unweighted                                          -0.0000        -0.0000        +0.0000
  linear, equal weight per galaxy                     +0.0000        +0.0000        +0.0000

  schemes unbiased to better than 0.01 dex on noiseless synthetics: 6 of 6
  with 0.13 dex log-normal scatter on g_obs: CORRECT: Phi^2/(sigma g_bar^req)^2           bias -0.0396 dex
  with 0.13 dex log-normal scatter on g_obs: linear (inverse variance in acceleration)    bias -0.0418 dex
  with 0.13 dex log-normal scatter on g_obs: linear on g_obs: 1/(sigma g_obs)^2           bias -0.0112 dex
